# 统一以 LF 存储，保证跨平台一致（文档、模板、脚本）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary

# 语言标记（便于 GitHub 统计与 diff）
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.html text
*.js text
